From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: awlx <6527744+awlx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:31:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] gluon-mesh-batman-adv: announce the captive portal in router
 advertisements

Pass the captive portal API URI to uradvd (RFC 8910, RA option 37) when
noderoute has written it to /tmp/captive_portal. noderoute writes the
file only when the Parker config service sends captive_portal_url.
--captive-portal needs uradvd from the freifunkMUC fork. Without the
file, the RA does not change.
---
 .../gluon-mesh-batman-adv/luasrc/lib/gluon/radvd/arguments | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/package/gluon-mesh-batman-adv/luasrc/lib/gluon/radvd/arguments b/package/gluon-mesh-batman-adv/luasrc/lib/gluon/radvd/arguments
index 9052b35..974e7a3 100755
--- a/package/gluon-mesh-batman-adv/luasrc/lib/gluon/radvd/arguments
+++ b/package/gluon-mesh-batman-adv/luasrc/lib/gluon/radvd/arguments
@@ -31,6 +31,13 @@ if adv_mtu then
 	io.write(" --adv-link-mtu " .. adv_mtu)
 end
 
+-- The captive portal API URI (RFC 8910). noderoute writes the file only
+-- when the config service sends one.
+local captive_portal = util.readfile("/tmp/captive_portal")
+if captive_portal then
+	io.write(" --captive-portal " .. captive_portal)
+end
+
 if site.radvd() then
 	if site.radvd.preferred_lifetime() then
 		io.write(" --preferred-lifetime " .. site.radvd.preferred_lifetime())
-- 
2.56.1

